# Dependencies
node_modules/
.npm
.yarn
.pnp.*

# TypeScript
# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally committed for this vendored fork. It is consumed
# locally via `file:../vendor/substack-api`, and pnpm packs the dependency at
# install time WITHOUT running its build, so a missing dist/ silently breaks
# `substack_social`. Committing the build output keeps the vendored package
# self-contained. Rebuild with `pnpm build` after editing src/, then commit.
# dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Documentation
docs/build/
docs/_build/
docs/api/

